      SYNTAX SEQUENCE OF IqAdjustEntry
      MAX-ACCESS not-accessible
      STATUS current
      DESCRIPTION
        "Table for IQ Adjust parameters."
      ::= { rsXx8000TransposerObjs 7 }

    
    iqAdjustEntry OBJECT-TYPE
      SYNTAX IqAdjustEntry
      MAX-ACCESS not-accessible
      STATUS current
      DESCRIPTION
        "An entry for the IQ Adjust parameter of a specific transposer."
