        }
      MAX-ACCESS read-only
      STATUS current
      DESCRIPTION
        "The event number as integer and the value as readable text.
        The enumeration correlates with the notifications under eventsTransposerV2."
      ::= { eventsTransposerEntry 3 }

    
    eventMask OBJECT-TYPE
